so with decks, we have set lock
	easy - detects some collision w/a player if not currently locked
	no need to handle in any way via networking

unset lock 1 - area exited and not moving deck
	deck move is dep on input
		so it's state we need to save
	then hitbox exited is just physics

unset lock 2 - unset lock when moved away from player
	so this happens when the user lets go of mouse move

whilst we're at it, what input do we send?
	start-move - deck, position
		set is_moving
	mid-move - deck, position
		set position
	end-move - deck, position
		set is_moving, lock mayb

also need network process to read all these
